WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:04.940
As one encounter led to a double romance...

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.740
...three beating hearts...

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.140
...played gentle melodies.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:12.450
I, Kasuga Kyosuke, 15 years old...

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.030
...am living the best years of my youth!

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:30.400
That's the accelerator screamin', as the tires are squealin'...

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.950
...takin' you along, a girl I hardly knew,
in my speedin' coupe.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:42.680
You slammed the door,
evadin' the shadows that followed...

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:49.420
...sayin' "Take me anywhere, Just go!"

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.320
An encounter is like a highway junction...

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:55.390
I've fallen in love with you - that I realized...

00:00:55.390 --> 00:01:01.430
...by the time the seaport was in sight...

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:04.530
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:13.310
Sayin' that you desire
tenderness over a caress...

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:16.640
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:25.650
...the way you avoided me, usin' that naive look, wasn't so innocent.

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.960
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:37.730
Sayin' that you desire
a caress over loneliness...

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:41.170
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:51.500
...the way you looked into my eyes as you turned back wasn't so innocent.

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:03.990
Madoka's Private Life?! A Spark-Colored Kiss.

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:06.230
Let's clean up! Splash, splash!

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.630
Don't move, Jingoro!

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:21.570
Hey, Jingoro! Hold it right there!

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:31.320
No! Gee...

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:32.390
There!

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:37.150
Kurumi!

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:40.370
'Cuz! 'Cuz! It's all Jingoro's fault!

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:43.410
What with all the exams,
I haven't had the time to bathe him.

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:46.560
So I wanted to clean him up, you know.

00:02:58.050 --> 00:02:59.420
Oh, Hikaru!

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:02.610
Howdy! Is Kasuga-sempai around?
Oh, Hikaru!

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:05.920
Oh... He went out somewhere.

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:08.010
Oh... I see...

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.790
He might be at Komatsu's!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.920
Oh, really?! Thank you!

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:20.800
Hey you! You're not to go outside, 'cuz you'll get dirty!

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:33.650
Hikaru!

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:35.710
Wh...?
Hikaru!

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:38.990
What the?! What do you want?!

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:43.080
H...Hikaru... Please go out with me from now on!

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:46.220
Do you have enough
spending money to take me out?

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.220
What? Oh, sure!

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:52.640
Lemmesee now...
I think I've got plenty for today...

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:55.190
Lemmesee... Oh! Hikaru!

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:01.850
Cool...!

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:03.380
What do you mean "Cool?!"

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:07.760
How many times did I ask you to bring Kurumi and Manami along?!

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:08.720
Right, Hatta?

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:09.580
Surely!
Right, Hatta?

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:09.650
Right, Hatta?

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:12.120
'Cause, otherwise there's no point in coming here!

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:12.760
Say what?

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:14.130
Huh?
Say what?

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:14.160
Geez!
Huh?

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:14.890
Geez!

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.550
I'm amazed at how much you've got!

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:19.390
No wonder you're a fan club member!

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:21.820
Don't you have any favorite singers, Kasuga?

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:25.770
He's got a girl he likes
within arm's reach anyway. Right?

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:31.770
Oh, yeah? But, I don't get it!
What's so great about that weird girl?

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:49.750
A "weird girl?!" She's not the kind of "weird girl" you think, Komatsu!

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:52.170
Not true! She's definitely weird!

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:55.690
I mean, she's hanging out with Ayukawa, when she's only a freshman!

00:04:56.170 --> 00:05:00.040
Huh?! Oh... You're talking about Hikaru?

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:03.240
Oh? Do you like somebody else besides her?

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.420
Er... no! Not really.

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:11.180
Still, despite what everybody thinks, I'm not really going with Hikaru.

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:14.290
There ya go again! Don't hide it, dude!

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:15.530
But, you know, Kasuga...

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:18.720
...you should try to make her steer clear of Ayukawa a bit.

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.560
What? Why is that?

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:24.230
See, Ayukawa may be quiet now...

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:27.900
...but, a while ago she was something else!

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:30.830
She was into a lot of
degenerate stuff, supposedly!

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:33.000
"D...Degenerate?!"

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.560
Yeah!
"D...Degenerate?!"

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:34.640
Just like this room! Yup!
Yeah!

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.830
Just like this room! Yup!

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:43.320
I'm not as degenerate as you are!
You filthy, conniving ass!

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:46.490
What the?! Ow!

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.740
Degeneracy is dynamite!

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:51.730
Now that I think about it...

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:55.990
...I know almost nothing about Ayukawa's past.

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:06.270
"Say..."

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:17.240
"Just for tonight...
can you let me stay over?"

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:20.640
"What?!"

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:30.130
I wonder if... that didn't just happen to me.

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:32.160
Maybe she's asked a lot of other guys!

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.830
Kasuga!

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.420
Huh?

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:44.240
I...I had no idea that I'd walked to Ayukawa's house!

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:47.910
What is it? What's up?

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:50.450
Er, say... you're not working at ABCB?

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:53.990
Master said that something came up,
so it's closed for the day.

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:55.850
And, what are you up to, Kasuga?

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:58.900
Oh, er, well, now that the exams are over...

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:01.010
...I figured that I'd just
hang out and kill time.

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:07.600
How in the world did I end up over here?

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:10.860
Honestly, I'm totally clueless!

00:08:09.490 --> 00:08:11.980
Oh! Er... Are we going in here?

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.000
Kids aren't supposed to go in here, eh?

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:16.730
Well...

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:18.570
If you don't want to, then we won't go in.

00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:23.300
Hey, you two, are you or aren't you coming in? What's the deal?

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:25.910
Oh! Madoka!

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:30.350
What do we do?!       You d...dummy!
Don't act like you don't have a clue!

00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:32.550
But, this isn't good!  You d...dummy!
Don't act like you don't have a clue!

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:36.710
M...Madoka, long time no see!

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:44.300
I was wondering, because I hadn't seen you for a while... Well, this explains it!

00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:45.900
This is totally unexpected!

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:49.690
You were known for not letting a guy get close to you, but look at you now!

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:53.730
I'm flabbergasted to see you
as part of a couple!

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:56.070
Aha... This kid, eh?

00:08:56.070 --> 00:08:57.770
The little boy's cute, don't you think?
Aha... This kid, eh?

00:08:57.770 --> 00:08:59.400
L...Little boy?!
The little boy's cute, don't you think?

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:04.880
Little boy, be sure to learn plenty of good things from Madoka, okay?

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:08.930
Definitely. I mean, Madoka knows all sorts of great things!

00:09:08.930 --> 00:09:10.380
There's THAT... and there's THAT...

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:14.420
And, then... there's THAT... and THAT... and THAT!

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:16.520
Knock it off!

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:20.070
You think you can mouth off,
just 'cause she's not defending herself?!

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:21.670
How dare you be so rude?!

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:25.330
What's wrong with stating the truth?
Eh, Madoka?

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:27.700
Why you... Apologize to her!

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.270
Say what?!

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:30.720
Kasuga... let's go!
Say what?!

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:31.210
What?
Kasuga... let's go!

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:31.340
What?

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:33.140
Come on!
What?

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:35.910
H...Hey, wait a sec!

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:37.680
What's up with her?

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:39.620
Maybe hanging out with a little boy...

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:39.640
What's up with her?

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:41.580
...has made her a little brat!

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:44.020
I'm not a "little boy!"

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:45.220
That's enough!

00:09:45.220 --> 00:09:46.820
You gotta be kidding me, Ayukawa!

00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:49.400
Doesn't hearing stuff like that piss you off?!

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.520
Why didn't you give him something back?!

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:56.430
'Cause, Kasuga, you said enough for me...

00:09:58.100 --> 00:10:01.270
...so, it's okay now.

00:10:01.270 --> 00:10:03.900
At that moment, I was...

00:10:05.110 --> 00:10:08.580
There's no better place than here
at times like these!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:11.690
...feeling how I looked like a pathetic little brat...

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:15.290
...having gotten upset about something so trivial.

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:19.630
The way Ayukawa handled it was so...

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:22.420
I am so ashamed.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:24.160
Here you go. The usual.

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:25.630
Thank you.
Here you go. The usual.

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:31.970
D...Don't tell me... this is...

00:10:31.970 --> 00:10:36.160
Don't worry!
There's only a little bit in there.

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:54.600
Oh! Look what time it is!

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:56.930
Gosh, where's Oniichan?!

00:10:56.930 --> 00:11:02.790
You said it! You said it!
Jingoro, kids shouldn't be out late, right?

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:06.160
Oh! You're so cute!

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:09.110
Are you all right?

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:10.070
Whatcha talkin' about?!
Are you all right?

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:11.570
Whatcha talkin' about?!

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:13.780
I'm not a kid, y'know!

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:15.110
Pull yourself together!

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:17.050
Sheesh! Leave me alone.
Pull yourself together!

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:17.070
Pull yourself together!

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:19.080
Like, what's up with everyone...

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:22.530
...treating me like some little brat?

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:24.420
Bet that's what you think of me,
isn't it, Ayukawa!

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:26.220
Oh, come on...

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:27.590
ShiShiShit!
Oh, come on...

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:27.600
Oh, come on...

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:29.660
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:35.320
I'm not some kid who gets drunk after having 5 or 6 baby drinks, I tell you!

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:37.260
But you only had two...

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:40.110
It doesn't matter how many I had!

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:43.680
I'm not drunk, I'm telling you.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:48.010
You're drunk when you start "seeing triple," you know.

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:54.910
Whwhwhat...? Since when are there
three of you, Ayukawa?

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:57.920
Look at yourself!

00:11:57.920 --> 00:12:00.290
I bet you're looking down on me!

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:05.640
Obviously, you're used to doing all sorts of "fun" things.

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:09.030
Compared to you,
I've got a long way to go.

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:15.930
S...Sorry...

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:18.740
The truth is, I didn't really mean that.

00:12:18.740 --> 00:12:19.840
It's okay.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.070
No, it's not okay!
It's okay.

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:21.140
It's okay.

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:25.200
I don't believe any of the things they're saying about you!

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.680
Ayukawa...

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:50.350
Ow!

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:53.500
Is this for real?!

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.100
Are you awake?

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:12.770
I'm... in my room?!

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:15.640
Golly, don't you remember anything, Oniichan?

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:19.510
I'm not surprised.
Coming home as drunk as that!

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:22.250
It's amazing how you were able to get home by yourself though.

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:24.460
That isn't something to be impressed about!

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:28.610
Papa was furious! He said Jr. High students
shouldn't drink alcohol.

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:31.890
Alcohol...?

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:49.570
Oh, shit...

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:52.580
You better get ready,
or you'll be late for school!

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:54.850
Don't be playing hooky now! Let's go.

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:56.180
Yup.

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:59.480
It ain't good...!

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:10.760
Yo!

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:14.730
Yikes...!

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:19.300
M...Morning, Ayukawa...

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.740
Oh, shit...

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:24.900
Say, where were you yesterday?
Oh, shit...

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:24.980
Oh, shit...

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:25.610
Hikaru was looking for you.

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:28.100
Huh?! What?! WhatWhatWhat?!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.160
All rise!

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:35.190
Bow!

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:44.060
Ayukawa!

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:48.200
Er... About last night...

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.360
I... I...

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:53.270
Oh! W... Wait!

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:56.980
C'mon, Kasuga! Move! The legendary Cutlet-Sandwiches will all be gone!

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:57.540
H...Hold on...

00:14:57.540 --> 00:15:00.350
Off we go... to that inexpensive, tasty, ultimate gourmet delight!

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:02.470
Ayukawa!

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:10.860
The Cutlet-Sandwich!

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:11.360
Nice, isn't it? All sold out, though.
The Cutlet-Sandwich!

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:12.910
Nice, isn't it? All sold out, though.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:15.630
Cutlet-Sandwich, I hate you!

00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:19.390
Kasuga-sempai! I missed you!

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:24.600
'Cause, 'cause... I was looking for you everywhere all day yesterday!

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:27.570
You show-off!
Whatta stud!

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:30.010
Listen, Hikaru...

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:31.200
What is it?
Listen, Hikaru...

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:31.280
N...Now might not be the best time.
What is it?

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:33.380
N...Now might not be the best time.

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:35.080
Why is that?

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:37.780
Well, everyone's watching, so...

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:39.520
Pretty cool, don't you think?

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:43.260
But, you know... Well...
how do I put it? Oh, I know!

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:46.420
Well, why not go somewhere where we can be alone and talk quietly?

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:49.200
Oh! Good idea!

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:52.030
So, I'll see you after school, at you-know-where.

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:53.630
"You-know-where?"

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:56.600
I'll be waiting for you at ABCB!
"You-know-where?"

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:05.470
ABCB?! I can't possibly
meet her there, of all places!

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:09.710
Oh? I thought I ordered an iced tea.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:12.420
I thought I did... didn't I?

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:14.720
Sorry about that.
I'll make you one right away!

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:17.910
It's okay... But, that sure is unusual.

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:22.860
'Cause, you got an order wrong...
Did something happen to upset you?

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:28.060
N...Nothing happened! Everything's fine!
It never went anywhere!

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:30.640
What?!

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:34.540
"It never went anywhere...?!" What do you mean?

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:39.410
Oh, my! How awful! I broke a cup!
Master, I'm sorry!

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:42.280
You know you did it on purpose!

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:47.080
Oh? Look what time it is!
Where is Darling?! He's so late!

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:49.950
Now that you mention it,
Kasuga hasn't been here all day.

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:53.110
O...Ouch!

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:00.830
Well, then, Master, good night.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.400
Oh, er, Madoka...

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:03.630
Yes?
Oh, er, Madoka...

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:03.700
Oh, er, Madoka...

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:06.910
I know I shouldn't butt into other people's business...

00:17:06.910 --> 00:17:09.110
...but, it's not good to
stew over things too much.

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:10.280
What?

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:13.340
When you're young,
all kinds of things happen, you know.

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:02.280
Oh!

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:07.270
The fact that she slapped me could be interpreted...

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:10.540
...as meaning that Ayukawa isn't the kind of girl...

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:13.430
...that everybody's saying that she is, or so it seems.

00:18:14.810 --> 00:18:18.830
I got interested in her past
just because of rumors. I'm...

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:26.910
I'm a...

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:50.810
Could I have a minute?

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.870
Yes! What can I do for you?
Could I have a minute?

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:56.780
Here might be a little, er...

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:57.480
Huh? Oh, right...
Here might be a little, er...

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:59.610
Huh? Oh, right...

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:04.400
Kasuga! The bakery folks are here!

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:08.530
C'mon! C'mon! We're gonna miss
the legendary Cutlet-Sandwich again!

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:08.830
C'mon, get with it!

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:10.850
H...Hey! Hey! Wait a sec!
C'mon, get with it!

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:10.930
C'mon, get with it!

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:13.930
Cutlet-Sandwich, here we come!
Ayukawa! See you later, okay?

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:18.470
At a time like this...!

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:21.210
Knock it off!

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:24.370
I was first!
Knock it off!

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:25.910
Don't push!
I was first!

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:26.040
Don't push!

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:26.810
That hurts!
Don't push!

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:26.880
Don't push!

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:28.910
Move it! Move it! Move it! MOVE!

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:33.840
How spineless I was. I was unable to say no to Komatsu's invitation.

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:48.030
I...I almost ended up becoming a Cutlet-Sandwich!

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:49.730
Here.

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:52.070
K...Kasuga, my bud, you've got guts!

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:54.270
Sempai! You're cruel!

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:55.870
What the...?! This again...?!
Sempai! You're cruel!

00:19:55.870 --> 00:19:56.870
What the...?! This again...?!

00:19:57.070 --> 00:20:00.340
I was waiting for you at ABCB!

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:07.280
Here you go! Say "Ah!"

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:13.920
I still think that something
must've happened to Madoka!

00:20:16.530 --> 00:20:21.540
'Cause, she's so unlike herself, so absent-minded!

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:25.440
She won't even tell me,
of all people, what happened.

00:20:25.440 --> 00:20:29.800
I bet something really shocking must've happened to her!

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:33.740
I tell ya, the legendary
Cutlet-Sandwich is so good!

00:20:33.740 --> 00:20:36.050
Say, have you seen Kasuga around?

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:39.080
I...I believe he went up to the roof.

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:41.210
Oh...

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:46.990
Here you go! Say "Ahh!"

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:54.330
I wonder if I'll make a good wife?

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:56.840
W...Well...

00:20:56.840 --> 00:20:59.410
At a time of crisis like this, this is what I'm doing...?

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:01.110
This is so disgraceful!

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:03.130
Here you go! Ahh!
This is so disgraceful!

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:15.790
Oh!

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:16.450
Huh? What happened?
Oh!

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:18.850
Huh? What happened?

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:22.230
Oh! Look! What's that?!

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:23.090
Huh?
Oh! Look! What's that?!

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:23.160
That! That! What the heck is that?!
Huh?

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:25.530
That! That! What the heck is that?!

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:27.190
What?! Where is it?!

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:30.670
See, it's near the sun!
Is it a UFO or something?!

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:35.510
I can't see very well, it's too bright!

00:21:35.510 --> 00:21:38.600
Where is it?

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:44.170
Sorry about that... Hikaru...

00:21:45.250 --> 00:21:47.120
Ayukawa!

00:21:47.120 --> 00:21:49.450
Dammit, it's all or nothing!

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:52.980
There!

00:22:01.770 --> 00:22:08.330
At a time like this, what should I say?
This feels so awkward.

00:22:09.670 --> 00:22:09.870
I... I...

00:22:09.870 --> 00:22:11.930
I...
I... I...

00:22:15.510 --> 00:22:19.510
Y'know, alcohol... er, well...
we have to be careful with it, eh?

00:22:20.420 --> 00:22:22.490
Was it... because of the alcohol?!

00:22:22.490 --> 00:22:24.060
What?!

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:25.120
What happened, I mean.

00:22:25.120 --> 00:22:30.920
W...Well, it's not the only thing to blame,
but... how can I put it...

00:22:31.530 --> 00:22:34.710
...it's true that I got
a little boost from the alcohol...

00:22:34.710 --> 00:22:37.830
...but that didn't mean that
it didn't matter who I was with, or...

00:22:38.370 --> 00:22:40.390
Just what the hell am I saying?!

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:43.570
Same here.

00:22:43.570 --> 00:22:45.630
What?!

00:22:50.110 --> 00:22:54.120
Drinking alcohol isn't
that great of a thing, it seems.

00:22:54.120 --> 00:22:58.710
I too... got drunk, after work, and asked you if I could...

00:23:00.460 --> 00:23:02.690
It's not that great of a thing after all.

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:04.300
Ayukawa!

00:23:04.300 --> 00:23:06.390
But, that was the only time...

00:23:07.730 --> 00:23:10.130
I bet you thought that I was quite the delinquent, huh?

00:23:10.130 --> 00:23:12.800
Oh! No, not at all!

00:23:12.800 --> 00:23:15.750
Ah... I'm starving!

00:23:15.750 --> 00:23:18.800
I didn't have lunch today!

00:23:19.980 --> 00:23:21.950
Would you like... to have this?

00:23:21.950 --> 00:23:23.940
Is that a "Legendary" whatever?
Would you like... to have this?

00:23:23.940 --> 00:23:24.020
Would you like... to have this?

00:23:24.020 --> 00:23:27.180
The Cutlet-Sandwich!

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.150
Darling? Where is it... The UFO, that is?

00:23:34.960 --> 00:23:36.670
Darling?

00:23:36.670 --> 00:23:39.200
D... Oh?

00:23:39.200 --> 00:23:42.360
Darling? Darling!

00:23:54.910 --> 00:24:02.530
I dream of casting a spell
that captures your heart...

00:24:02.530 --> 00:24:10.100
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:25.450
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory. I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:25.450 --> 00:24:38.060
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:38.060 --> 00:24:48.270
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:48.270 --> 00:24:55.280
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:55.280 --> 00:25:06.680
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:13.220 --> 00:25:15.630
I'm at the beach right now.

00:25:15.630 --> 00:25:18.300
The dazzling sunshine...
the splashing spray of seawater...

00:25:18.300 --> 00:25:21.940
Hikaru is looking so sparkling... and Ayukawa's smiles are...

00:25:21.940 --> 00:25:24.070
...well... simply awesome!

00:25:24.070 --> 00:25:27.010
If only time could stand still.

00:25:27.010 --> 00:25:30.780
Next time: "You're Smiling!
A 'Shutter-Chance' at the Beach."

00:25:30.780 --> 00:25:33.710
I'm... speechless!
